    in your Spell & Trap Zone as face-up Continuous Spells, and Special Summon 1
    "Arc Token" (Machine/LIGHT/ATK 0/DEF 0) with a Level equal to the number placed,
    also for the rest of this turn, you cannot Special Summon from the Extra Deck,
    except Synchro Monsters. You can only use each effect of "Witness of the Ancient"
    once per turn.'
